Simple and easy, append and edit meta tags "title" and "description" on WooCommerce product category pages. Created for SEO purposes.

== Description ==

This is a light-weight plugin to enable you to add or edit two popular meta tags on WooCommerce Product Categories, the meta tags with names "title" and "description".

- This plugin was designed with SEO purposes in mind.
- It's simple and easy to use.

Simply edit the Product Category like normal. From this page you will see two new fields to edit the meta tags. The result is something like this:

`
<meta name="title" content="Cherry Red Convertable" />
<meta name="description" content=" .. " />
`

== Installation ==

This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/simple-pcme` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= Where do I add or edit the meta tags? =

Go to Products > Categories. Click *edit* on the category you wish to add meta tags to. On the edit product category page, notice two new fields: SEO meta title, and SEO meta description.

= Can I add any more meta tags? =

No. At this time we only support adding and editing the meta tags with names "title", and "description". However, if you require additional functionality, please request it from the author.

